  {
    "index": "tinker",
    "name": "Tinker",
    "desc": "You have proficiency with artisan's tools (tinker's tools). Using those tools, you can spend 1 hour and 10 gp worth of materials to construct a Tiny clockwork device (AC 5, 1 hp). The device ceases to function after 24 hours (unless you spend 1 hour repairing it to keep the device functioning), or when you use your action to dismantle it; at that time, you can reclaim the materials used to create it. You can have up to three such devices active at a time.\n\nWhen you create a device, choose one of the following options:\n\nClockwork Toy: This toy is a clockwork animal, monster, or person, such as a frog, mouse, bird, dragon, or soldier. When placed on the ground, the toy moves 5 feet across the ground on each of your turns in a random direction. It makes noises as appropriate to the creature it represents.\n\nFire Starter: The device produces a miniature flame, which you can use to light a candle, torch, or campfire. Using the device requires your action.\n\nMusic Box: When opened, this music box plays a single song at a moderate volume. The box stops playing when it reaches the song's end or when it is closed.",
    "races": [],
    "subraces": [
      "rock-gnome"
    ],
    "proficiencies": [
      "tinkers-tools"
    ],
    "parent": null,
    "choices": []
  },
